out the job application?\n<br><span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>:  Hi, Kristi! Yes, I just got an e-mail. I'm meeting them next week.\n<br><span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: That's great!\n<br><span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: The interview is next Wednesday. Listen to this!", "id": 0}, {"time": "12000", "image": "engenn9le13ob01re2img05.jpg", "text": "Dear Mr. Bari,<br><br>Thank you for expressing interest in the position of Web Content Editor at our publication Never Odd Or Even. Your resum\u00e9 demonstrates that you have the appropriate educational background and qualifications for this position.<br><br>We would like to invite you for an interview on Wednesday, January 22nd. The selection committee will be ready to talk to you at 10:00 a.m. At that time, we would request that you provide the names of three people who can attest to your professional skills. We would also like you to elaborate on your volunteer experience at the campus newspaper. If possible, could you please prepare a portfolio of the work you completed in the past?<br><br>Could you please confirm your attendance at your earliest convenience?<br><br>Yours sincerely,<br><br>Frank Mitchell", "id": 1}, {"time": "61000", "image": "engenn9le13ob01re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>:  That's great! Congratulations! Have you responded yet?\n<br><span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: Yes, I just sent this e-mail:", "id": 2}, {"time": "68000", "image": "engenn9le13ob01re2img06.jpg", "text": "Dear Mr. Mitchell,<br><br>Thank you very much for this opportunity to have an interview with you. I would be happy to meet with you on January 22nd at 10:00 a.m. It would be my pleasure to bring the names of three references.  I appreciate the chance to discuss how my background and education are suited to the position. I would be proud to show you examples of my writing. I look forward to meeting you in person.<br><br>Yours truly,<br><br>Adam Bari", "id": 3}, {"time": "94000", "image": "engenn9le13ob01re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: That's so exciting!  What are you going to wear?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>:  I will be wearing a grey jacket and a tie I bought.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: Oh, I wouldn't wear the grey jacket. Why don't you wear your black suit?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: I will have worn that suit two times before. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: That's fine. It's in great condition.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>:  OK, I'm going to wear my light blue shirt.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Kristi </span>: Good choice!<br>", "id": 4}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}